menu "WS2812B Clock"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "Blink GPIO number"
        range 0 39
        default 2
        help
            GPIO driving the status LED. Most generic ESP32 devkits
            (DOIT DevKit V1 and clones) have the onboard LED on GPIO2.

    config BLINK_PERIOD_MS
        int "Blink period (ms)"
        range 10 3600000
        default 1000
        help
            Time the LED spends in each state.

endmenu
